FEXCore builds for iOS (FEX 14c9268, on top of 0006)

WinPad's iPad test app links FEXCore as static libraries, as Madeira does
(its fork willfaust/FEX, branch ios-port-2607, made the same kind of
changes; the portable ones are taken from there). Linux and Windows builds
are unchanged.

- CMake accepts CMAKE_SYSTEM_NAME=iOS and then builds only FEXHeaderUtils,
  CodeEmitter and FEXCore (no Linux frontend, no FEX allocators, no
  pthread library to link).
- Linux-only headers and syscalls get Darwin equivalents: gettid via
  pthread_threadid_np, signal masks via pthread_sigmask, prctl as a stub
  that fails, file copies via fcopyfile.

